It was evolved for speed on ground. Evolution lasted 100M steps (10000gens). Its early form appeared quite early.
~
info_performance:~
It moves by the means of a single limb, its tail. It is interesting how it manages to raise the whole body only by the tail. Avg. speed is 0.0072, max. 0.012.~
