info:Huge dragon-like walking creature.
info_origin:3
info_how_created:~
I started natural evolution under various conditions, when an interesting mutation happened. I picked that genotype and evolved it further.
2025-01, Maciej Komosinski: evolved weights for a more reliable movement.~
info_performance:~
It has a long tail, two legs and two scissor-like limbs. It moves very awkward, but it is very huge.~
